!!! 01-hello.matrix
!!! The smallest complete Matrix program, and every lexical form.
!!!
!!! Equivalent Ny:
!!!     module hello
!!!     fn main() -> i32
!!!         println("Hello from Matrix")
!!!         return 0
!!!     end fn

book hello

!!! A comment. Anything after the three marks is ignored.
!!!
!!! A bare line of three marks is an empty comment line, which is how a
!!! multi-line comment is written: every line carries its own marker.
!!!
!!! The draft also proposed a block form, opened and closed by a line that is
!!! exactly three marks. It was dropped because the two forms cannot coexist:
!!! the blank line two lines above this one would be a block delimiter, and a
!!! file header is full of such lines. Ny has line comments only for the same
!!! reason.

main returns number begin paragraph
    say "Hello from Matrix"
    give 0
end paragraph
